# No header, so this directory claims no namespace and these definitions carry
# no canonical path. They are still addressable by directory (D4.12), so two
# files defining one name in one directory is still `E0230`: renaming a file
# would otherwise decide which one `./Widget` names.
--- !type &Widget
alpha: !!int 1
